{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Config is a collection of tools we currently use between our projects to simplify configuration."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"required-pre-requisites","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Required Pre-Requisites"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The following tools are required to use these packages:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://nodejs.org/en/download/current/","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Node.js v20.17.0+"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://git-scm.com/downloads","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Git CLI"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://cli.github.com/","children":[{"type":"text","value":"GitHub CLI"}]},{"type":"text","value":" (pre-installed on GitHub Actions)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://pnpm.io/","children":[{"type":"text","value":"pnpm v10+"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"pnpm is the only supported package manager for TanStack Config."}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"utilities","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Utilities"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./eslint.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"ESLint"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./publish.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Publish"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./vite.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vite"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"conventions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Conventions"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./ci-cd.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"CI/CD"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./dependencies.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Dependencies"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./package-structure.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Package Structure"}]}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"required-pre-requisites","text":"Required Pre-Requisites","level":2},{"id":"utilities","text":"Utilities","level":2},{"id":"conventions","text":"Conventions","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nTanStack Config is a collection of tools we currently use between our projects to simplify configuration.\n\n## Required Pre-Requisites\n\nThe following tools are required to use these packages:\n\n- [Node.js v20.17.0+](https://nodejs.org/en/download/current/)\n- [Git CLI](https://git-scm.com/downloads)\n- [GitHub CLI](https://cli.github.com/) (pre-installed on GitHub Actions)\n- [pnpm v10+](https://pnpm.io/)\n\n> pnpm is the only supported package manager for TanStack Config.\n\n## Utilities\n\n- [ESLint](./eslint.md)\n- [Publish](./publish.md)\n- [Vite](./vite.md)\n\n## Conventions\n\n- [CI/CD](./ci-cd.md)\n- [Dependencies](./dependencies.md)\n- [Package Structure](./package-structure.md)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: overview\ntitle: Overview\n---\n\nTanStack Config is a collection of tools we currently use between our projects to simplify configuration.\n\n## Required Pre-Requisites\n\nThe following tools are required to use these packages:\n\n- [Node.js v20.17.0+](https://nodejs.org/en/download/current/)\n- [Git CLI](https://git-scm.com/downloads)\n- [GitHub CLI](https://cli.github.com/) (pre-installed on GitHub Actions)\n- [pnpm v10+](https://pnpm.io/)\n\n> pnpm is the only supported package manager for TanStack Config.\n\n## Utilities\n\n- [ESLint](./eslint.md)\n- [Publish](./publish.md)\n- [Vite](./vite.md)\n\n## Conventions\n\n- [CI/CD](./ci-cd.md)\n- [Dependencies](./dependencies.md)\n- [Package Structure](./package-structure.md)\n"}
